{
	"title": "Calculer avec des puissances",
	"description": "Calcul numérique, exposants relatifs : résultat entier, fraction irréductible, notation scientifique",
	"grades": ["2"],
	"theme": "Puissances",
	"domain": "Calculer",
	"subdomain": "Mixer tout ça",
	"level": 3,
	"delay": 60,
	"status": "draft",
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Calcule.\n\n$$\\dfrac{ {{k}}^{ {{a}} }\\times {{k}}^{ {{b}} } }{ {{k}}^{ {{c}} } }=?$$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "2|3"
				},
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "1..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "3..7"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "-5..-1"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "eval:(a)+(b)-(r)"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["(k)^(r) <= 81", "c != 0", "c != 1", "(a)+(b) != 0"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:(k)^(r)}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On écrit d'abord une seule puissance de ${{k}}$. Règles : $a^m\\times a^n=a^{m+n}$ ; $\\dfrac{a^m}{a^n}=a^{m-n}$ ; $(a^m)^n=a^{m\\times n}$.",
					"$$\\dfrac{ {{k}}^{ {{a}} }\\times {{k}}^{ {{b}} } }{ {{k}}^{ {{c}} } }={{k}}^{ {{a}}+{{if:b<0|({{b}})|{{b}}}}-{{if:c<0|({{c}})|{{c}}}} }=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{k}}^{ {{r}} }}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.1}}}{{{eval:(k)^(r)}}}$$"
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Calcule et donne le résultat sous la forme d'une fraction irréductible.\n\n$$\\dfrac{2^{ {{a}} }\\times 3^{ {{b}} } }{2^{ {{c}} }\\times 3^{ {{d}} } }=?$$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "u",
					"expression": "-2..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "v",
					"expression": "-2..2"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..5"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "1..4"
				},
				{
					"name": "c",
					"expression": "eval:(a)-(u)"
				},
				{
					"name": "d",
					"expression": "eval:(b)-(v)"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["c >= 1", "d >= 1", "u < 0 or v < 0", "u > 0 or v > 0"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:2^(u)*3^(v)}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On regroupe les puissances de $2$, puis celles de $3$ : $\\dfrac{a^m}{a^n}=a^{m-n}$.",
					"$$\\dfrac{2^{ {{a}} }\\times 3^{ {{b}} } }{2^{ {{c}} }\\times 3^{ {{d}} } }=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{2^{ {{u}} }}\\times\\textcolor{{{color:primary.1}}}{3^{ {{v}} }}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.2}}}{{{eval:2^(u)*3^(v)}}}$$",
					"Un exposant négatif envoie la puissance au dénominateur : $a^{-n}=\\dfrac{1}{a^n}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Calcule et donne le résultat en notation scientifique.\n\n$${{p}}\\times10^{ {{a}} }\\times{{q}}\\times10^{ {{b}} }=?$$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "p",
					"expression": "2..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "q",
					"expression": "2..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "2..9"
				},
				{
					"name": "b",
					"expression": "-9..-2"
				},
				{
					"name": "w",
					"expression": "eval:(a)+(b)"
				}
			],
			"conditions": ["(p)*(q) >= 10", "w != 0", "w != -1", "w != 0"],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:(p)*(q)/10;d}}\\times10^{ {{eval:(a)+(b)+1}} }"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On multiplie les nombres entre eux, puis les puissances de $10$ entre elles.",
					"$${{p}}\\times10^{ {{a}} }\\times{{q}}\\times10^{ {{b}} }=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:(p)*(q)}}}\\times\\textcolor{{{color:primary.1}}}{10^{ {{eval:(a)+(b)}} }}$$",
					"${{eval:(p)*(q)}}$ n'est pas compris entre $1$ et $10$ : ${{eval:(p)*(q)}}={{eval:(p)*(q)/10;d}}\\times10$, donc",
					"$${{eval:(p)*(q)}}\\times10^{ {{eval:(a)+(b)}} }={{eval:(p)*(q)/10;d}}\\times10^{1+{{if:w<0|({{w}})|{{w}}}} }=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.2}}}{{{eval:(p)*(q)/10;d}}\\times10^{ {{eval:(a)+(b)+1}} }}$$"
				]
			}
		}
	],
